### Eliminar ruta por RouteId — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "removalReason": "Ruta creada por error durante pruebas"
}

### Eliminar ruta por PrivateCode — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privateCode": "RUTA-001",
  "removalReason": "Ruta descontinuada"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "removalReason": "Ruta creada por error durante pruebas"
}

### Sin RouteId ni PrivateCode → 400 (se requiere al menos uno)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "removalReason": "Sin identificador"
}

### RouteId y PrivateCode a la vez → 400 (solo uno de los dos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "privateCode": "RUTA-001",
  "removalReason": "Ambos identificadores enviados"
}

### RouteId inexistente → 400 (RAISERROR del SP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 999999999,
  "removalReason": "Ruta que no existe"
}
